# SRG SRG-APP-000439-WSR-000192: The web server must use HTTP/2, at a minimum.
# STIG ID: V-264362 (MEDIUM)
# Check: HTTP probe of web server endpoint

META
    esp_id `web-srg-srg-app-000439-wsr-000192-http-http2-enabled-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `web-server`
    criticality `high`

    title `SRG SRG-APP-000439-WSR-000192: The web server must use HTTP/2, at a minimum.`
    description `The web server must use HTTP/2, at a minimum.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `web-server,srg,disa-stig,http,external`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:SRG-APP-000439-WSR-000192,NIST-800-53:SC-8`
    control_objective `SC-8`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `WebServer:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Web Server SRG guidance for SRG-APP-000439-WSR-000192.`

    component_id `comp-web-server`

    impl_SC_8 `This control is validated by probing the web server configuration or network endpoint against the DISA Web Server SRG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    VAR web_url string `https://localhost/`

    OBJECT web_http
        url VAR web_url
        insecure `true`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE http_check
        connected boolean = true
        protocol string = `HTTP/2`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN http_probe
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF http_check
            OBJECT_REF web_http
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
